    ContentEN = "Those crimson eyes quiver ever so slightly, like petals trembling in the wind.",
    ContentFR = "Ses yeux rouges vacillent, tels des pétales battus par le vent.",
    ContentJP = "その赤い瞳は風に揺れる花弁のように微かに震えた。",
    ContentKR = "마치 바람에 흔들리는 꽃잎처럼, 붉은 눈동자가 가늘게 떨린다.",
    ContentTC = "那雙紅色的眼瞳微微顫動，如風中搖曳的花瓣。",
