  ["0F4665F6"] = {
    Content = "“唉，唉，你们都被传颂会那帮家伙教傻了。”他连连叹气，似乎对你的答案很不满意，“实话实说多无趣啊——你难道就不想换个其他样式的提灯？”",
    ContentEN = "Tsk, tsk, the Elysian Church has turned you all into such dull people. He sighs dramatically, disapproving of your choice. \"Honesty is so dreadfully dull. Don't you want a new lantern?\"",
