  ["0F8586F0"] = {
    Content = "“和他们失散以后，我已经一个人走了很久、很久。如果不是遇到了你，我都要怀疑自己是受到神罚，掉进什么地狱了呢。”",
    ContentEN = "\"After losing them, I wandered alone for ages. Meeting you now it's the first proof that I'm not damned to walk this hellscape for eternity.\"",
