  ["0F866BF8"] = {
    Content = "伴随着痛苦的叫喊声，青年举起了手中的长剑。一剑、一剑、又一剑，直到那幽影终于消散。\n面对已经化为灰烬的同伴，他用长剑撑着摇摇欲坠的身体，失声痛哭。",
    ContentEN = "With a cry, he swings his blade — once, twice, again — until the Abyssoid at last dissolves into ash.\nHis body trembles, held up only by the sword. Before the dust that was once his comrade, he breaks, his voice torn by grief, and weeps aloud.",
    ContentFR = "Dans un cri, il lève son épée et frappe — encore, encore, encore — jusqu’à ce que l’Umbré se dissolve enfin en cendres. Vacillant, il s’appuie sur sa lame plantée au sol. Devant ce qu’il reste de son ancienne compagne, il s’effondre, sanglotant à s’en briser la voix.",
    ContentJP = "苦痛に満ちた叫び声と共に、青年は再び剣を手に取った。一撃、また一撃、暗影が完全に消えるまで、彼は剣を振り続けていた。\n すでに灰になった昔の仲間の遺骸を前に、彼は倒れそうな体を剣にもたれかけ、声を上げて泣き崩れていた。",
