  ["19257936"] = {
    Content = "毕竟，我已经为了伺候那位棘手的要人小心翼翼地准备了一个月，终于在明天就能把她送走，处理积压如山的车站其他事务。",
    ContentEN = "I've spent a month preparing for that dignitary's arrival. Tomorrow she leaves, and I can finally start clearing the backlog that's been piling up.",
