  ["194EFFA4"] = {
    Content = "可我舍不得用。我想，既然是珍贵的宝物，如果埋在土里，等到收获的时节，就能长出好多个相机了。那时家里就会富有起来，爸爸妈妈也就不用那么辛苦。",
    ContentEN = "But I cherished it too much to actually play with it. I thought, if I buried this precious treasure in the ground, it would sprout many more cameras by harvest time. Then our family would become rich, and my parents wouldn't have to work so hard.",
