    ContentEN = "Lonza Fortress overlooks the Agate Valley from high ground. Once a key stronghold guarding the river routes between the Imperial Capital and Scarletriver, it played a pivotal role in the early days of the Empire. It was here that Emperor Galea, the first emperor of Hyperborea, orchestrated a decisive ambush, defeating a coalition of enemies and cementing the Empire's unification.",
