  AF460142 = {
    Content = "简陋的小帐篷，贝琳达长居于此，并且经营着一家起咨询作用的小店，没有招牌，没有明确的咨询范围，往来的客人似乎有自己的难言之隐。",
    ContentEN = "A humble tent where Belinda has made her home and runs a small advisory shop, with no sign nor a clear business scope. Her clients seem to bring with them their own unspoken woes.",
